    {
      "id": "c1",
      "type": "concept",
      "headline": "Your eyes will find a shape in anything.",
      "body": "Show a person random numbers plotted as a line and they will name a shape within seconds. That skill kept our ancestors alive. On a price chart it means you will see structure whether or not any structure is there."
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "type": "concept",
      "headline": "A pattern is a named shape.",
      "body": "Chart patterns are shapes traders gave names to: a **head and shoulders**, a triangle, a flag. Each comes with a story about what happens next. The shape is real. The story is the part worth questioning.",
      "art": {
        "kind": "glyph",
        "name": "candle",
        "bg": "sky"
      }
    },
